extends RefCounted
# Opaque block lettering made of triangles: a 5×7 cell font for capitals,
# Cyrillic, digits and a little punctuation. It needs no font import, SVG or
# alpha sorting, works on the minimal Web template and merges into a baked mesh
# with the surface it is printed on (mesh_merge.gd replaces Label3D with it).
# Text is centred on the origin in the XY plane, readable from +Z.
